OL,3,AUK says Brexit reset deal 'done' but
OL,4,Atalks to continue in some areas after
OL,5,AEU tuition fees demand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK says a "deal is done" with the
OL,8,FEU after talks in Brussels to secure a
OL,9,Fnew agreement covering issues such as
OL,10,Fyouth mobility, food exports, carbon
OL,11,Femissions and migration
OL,13,FWe are expecting to hear from Andy
OL,14,FBurnham and EU leaders shortly - you
OL,15,Fcan watch live at the top of the page
OL,17,FThe UK prime minister says the deal is
OL,18,F"really significant" and will bring
OL,19,Fbenefits to people across Europe and
OL,20,Fthe UK.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
