OL,3,ATens of thousands of UK fridges secured
OL,4,Afrom hackers in secret nationwide
OL,5,Aoperation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA behind the scenes cyber-security
OL,8,Foperation has taken place to secure
OL,9,Ftens of thousands of fridges and
OL,10,Ffreezers at major UK supermarkets,
OL,11,Fwarehouses, restaurants, petrol
OL,12,Fstations and stadiums from hackers, the
OL,13,FBBC has learned.
OL,15,FRecent waves of cyber-attacks in Europe
OL,16,Fhave seen tonnes of food spoiled at
OL,17,Fhundreds of stores, causing millions of
OL,18,Fpounds of damage.
OL,20,FFrance has blamed Iran for one of the
OL,21,Fwaves of attacks that impacted its
OL,22,Fsupermarkets, a claim Tehran denies.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
